--=============================================================
--  TAP x10  —  MOBILE / iPAD  —  TOUCH ONLY
--  • only listens to real taps (Enum.UserInputType.Touch)
--  • replays each tap using touch events (SendTouchEvent), NOT mouse clicks
--  • small draggable ⚡ button, tap to open/close panel
--  • smooth top-RIGHT notification (lowered) on toggle
--=============================================================

